  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-03-15T02:20:31.323Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "With the addition of the VRC Animator Play Audio state behavior, it's become very hard to ignore how frustrating it can be to make modifications to an animator that uses VRC state behaviors. It was already a bit of a pain with the Parameter Driver behavior, but it's on a whole different level with the Play Audio behavior.\n\nThere are so many options you can choose, it becomes an absolute chore if you need to move things around between different states. Or simply trying to have similar settings in each state you play audio from. Our only recourse right now is to either use Unity presets (which is also fairly cumbersome), or to rely on community-made tools.\n\nPlease give us a built-in way copy/paste not just with the Play Audio state, but with all VRC State Behaviors.",
